title: "ucai-sovereign-box: Single-GPU Sovereign Research-in-a-Box with Hybrid Retrieval, Spoke 1/2 Safeguards, and RO-Crate 1.1 Packaging"
message: "If you use ucai-sovereign-box or UCAI-SovereignBox-Bench-v2 in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
