abstract: >-
  Air-gapped single-GPU research-in-a-box combining inverted Okapi BM25 +
  all-MiniLM-L6-v2 hybrid retrieval across full open-access PDF corpora,
  deterministic Spoke 1/2 citation-numeric and prompt-injection safeguards,
  optional local open-weight LLM verification (Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct on T4),
  and FAIR4RS RO-Crate 1.1 + SHA-256 provenance packaging at $0.00 cloud cost.
